<title>BELGIUM: Belgolux H1 96 current account surplus widens.</title>
<headline>Belgolux H1 96 current account surplus widens.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian National Bank released the following provisional data on trade in the Belgo-Luxembourg Economic Union (in billions of francs)</p>
<p>					    Jan-Jul 96     Jan-Jul 1995</p>
<p>    CURRENT ACCOUNT			  243	     231</p>
<p>    -- Goods				   138	     131</p>
<p>    -- Services				 64		55</p>
<p>    -- Receipts				123	     104</p>
<p>    -- Current transfers		   -81	     -58</p>
<p>    -- Direct investments		 +114	     -47</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures given on a cash basis (transactions are recorded when money is paid, as opposed to when goods pass frontier).</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
